  - Item: Pistol
    Price: 250
    Blurb: For when guests get attacked. Left mouse shoots, right mouse aims, R reloads.
  - Item: SMG
    Price: 600
    Blurb: Sprays. Hold the trigger. 30 rounds.
  - Item: Shotgun
    Price: 700
    Blurb: Eight pellets a shot. Knocks you back too.
  - Item: Rifle
    Price: 900
    Blurb: Full auto, accurate when you aim. Takes a 4x scope.
  - Item: Sniper
    Price: 1200
    Blurb: One shot, one pirate. 8x scope included.
